# Placeholder so the libs/ directory is tracked while its .aar contents are not.
#
# CI drops one fused gomobile artifact here (git-ignored, see ../../.gitignore):
#   tenebra.aar  — the unmodified sing-box engine (io.nekohasekai.libbox) AND our
#                  config generator (io.nekohasekai.tenebracore.Tenebracore), bound
#                  together in a single pass by
#                    gomobile bind -target android -androidapi 23 \
#                      -javapkg io.nekohasekai -o ui-android/app/libs/tenebra.aar \
#                      . github.com/sagernet/sing-box/experimental/libbox
#                  run from ./mobile (see scripts/build-libbox-android.sh).
